   191	   > - (i) it preserves **every A9.6 custody and policy requirement**: complete-frame validation; the declared-time
   192	   >   check on its own clock before signing; the issuing account able to enqueue but not to invoke the key, change
   193	   >   the policy or clock, or obtain key-use credentials; and the key dedicated to V1 type-0x00 documents. It also
   194	   >   preserves every property in the frozen custody record (`270ca49:docs/V1-PROFILE.md:1017-1040`) except the
   195	   >   identity of the implementation, its 2026-10-14 deadline evidence and its prototype paths, which this option
   196	   >   replaces;
   197	   > - (ii) the external custody record names the deployed implementation, its image digest and its configuration;
   198	   > - (iii) deployed evidence is earned on the new bytes. That means: a deployed positive signature that verifies
