    87	Before the first **public verifier release**: the custody procedure and its rehearsal; the production release key;
    88	the fingerprint channels the author names; the release-format vectors; the **GCP VPC Service Controls perimeter**;
    89	and a **policy for responses the signer was not asked for** (E-06). Deployment does not cancel any of them.
